---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const link =
  "text-fg underline decoration-fg-faint underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:decoration-fg";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | coolLabs">
  <h1 class="px-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg md:text-5xl">
    Terms of service<span class="text-warning">.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl px-4 text-base text-pretty text-fg-dim">
    Rules for using our services.
  </p>

  <article
    class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 text-left text-[15px] leading-7 text-fg-dim
    [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:text-fg
    [&_p]:mt-3 [&_strong]:font-medium [&_strong]:text-fg
    [&_ul]:mt-3 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:pl-5
    [&_ol]:mt-3 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:space-y-1.5 [&_ol]:pl-5 [&_li]:marker:text-fg-faint"
  >
      <p class="!mt-0 mb-6 border-b border-hairline pb-6 text-xs text-fg-faint">
        Last Updated: March 23, 2025
      </p>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the services and
        applications ("products") provided by coolLabs Solutions Kft. ("we",
        "us", or "our") under the domains coollabs.io, coolify.io,
        images.coollabs.io, safetyper.com, and all subdomains, as well as any
        other services we may launch.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using our products, you agree to be bound by these
        Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must stop
        using our products immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>Our services</h2>
      <p>We develop and maintain open-source products, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Coolify</strong>: A self-hosting platform
          for deploying applications, databases, and services
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Jean</strong>: An AI-powered development
          tool
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Fonts</strong>: A privacy-friendly Google
          Fonts replacement
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Other products</strong>: Any additional
          services available through our domains
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our
        products at any time without prior notice.
      </p>

      <h2>User accounts</h2>
      <p>When you create an account with us, you agree to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide accurate and complete information</li>
        <li>Keep your login credentials secure and confidential</li>
        <li>
          Accept responsibility for all activity that occurs under your account
        </li>
        <li>Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to use our products to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
        <li>Infringe on the rights of others</li>
        <li>
          Disrupt, overload, or abuse our infrastructure or other users'
          experience
        </li>
        <li>
          Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems or other users'
          accounts
        </li>
        <li>
          Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble our products beyond what
          is permitted by their open-source licenses
        </li>
        <li>Distribute malware, spam, or other harmful content</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Our products are primarily open-source and released under their
        respective licenses (e.g., Apache 2.0, MIT). You are free to use,
        modify, and distribute the source code in accordance with those
        licenses.
      </p>
      <p>
        The coolLabs name, logos, branding, and trademarks remain the property
        of coolLabs Solutions Kft. and may not be used without our prior written
        consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Payment & refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Some of our products offer paid features or subscriptions. By purchasing
        a paid plan, you agree to pay the fees listed at the time of purchase.
        All payments are processed securely through third-party payment
        providers.
      </p>
      <p>
        For details on refunds, please refer to our
        <a href="/refund-policy" class={link}
          >Refund Policy</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        We work hard to keep our products reliable, secure, and available.
        However, no software is perfect — bugs happen, servers hiccup, and
        things occasionally break. We can't promise 100% uptime or a
        completely error-free experience, but we're always working to improve.
      </p>
      <p>
        If something does go wrong, our responsibility is limited to
        refunding what you paid us in the last month. We're a small team
        building open-source software, and this helps us keep doing that.
      </p>

      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may suspend or terminate your access to our products at any time if
        you violate these Terms, without prior notice. You may stop using our
        products at any time by deleting your account.
      </p>
      <p>
        Upon termination, your right to use our products ceases immediately. Any
        provisions of these Terms that by their nature should survive
        termination will remain in effect.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of Hungary. Any disputes arising
        from or relating to these Terms or our products shall be resolved in the
        courts of Hungary.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Updated versions will be
        posted on this page and we will notify you via email or within our
        products. Continued use of our services after changes are posted means
        you accept the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms? Reach out to us:</p>
      <ul class="!list-none !pl-0">
        <li>
          <strong>Email</strong>: hi [(at])
          coollabs.io
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>More Info</strong>:
          <a
            href="https://coolify.io/docs/contact"
            class={link}>https://coolify.io/docs/contact</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="!mt-12 border-t border-hairline pt-6 text-fg-faint">
        By using our products, you agree to these Terms of Service.
      </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
